  "content": "[Intro]\n[G]\n[Gmaj7]\n[Em7]\n[Am]\n[D]\n[D7]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[G]Hold me close and hold me\n[Gmaj7]fast The magic spell you\n[Em7]cast This is la vie en\n[Am]rose\n[D]When you kiss me, Heaven\n[Am]sighs And though I close my\n[F#dim/C]eyes I see la vie en\n[D][Bm]rose\n[G]When you press me to your\n[Gmaj7]heart And in a world a-\n[Em7]part A world where roses\n\n[Chorus]\n[Am]bloom\n[G]And when you speak Angels\n[Am]sing from above\n[D]Every day words Seems to\n[Cm]turn into love songs\n\n[Verse 2]\n[G]Give your heart and soul to\n[Gmaj7]me And life will always\n[C]be\n[Am]La vie en rose\n\n[Outro]\n[G]",
